AArch64 lane-rpos-acquire
"the consumer loads a record word (a) then stores rpos (b) with release; the producer loads rpos with acquire, then writes over the word"
{
0:X1=a; 0:X3=b;
1:X1=a; 1:X3=b;
}
 P0           | P1 ;
 LDR W0,[X1]  | LDAR W0,[X3] ;
 MOV W2,#16   | MOV W2,#1 ;
 STLR W2,[X3] | STR W2,[X1] ;
exists (0:X0=1 /\ 1:X0=16)
